:: Scene modifier
This line is not drawn. A passage with a [scene] in it is played full screen,
and only the scene is played -- prose, notes and other modifiers around the YAML
are ignored. Click the stage to advance beats.

[scene]
id: tavern-night
bg: tavern/night
camera: {at: [0, 0], zoom: 1}
cast:
  mira:  {at: -0.4, frame: arms-crossed}
  joren: {at: 0.35, frame: idle, flip: true, layer: back}
props:
  candle: {at: [0.1, -0.2], layer: front}
fx: [rain@0.6]
beats:
  - mira: "You shouldn't have come back."
  - joren: "And yet."
  - mira: {frame: angry, at: -0.25, say: "Get out."}
  - wait: 0.5
  - mark: tense
  - box: "The candle gutters."
links:
  stay: {to: Scene modifier patch}
  page: {to: Scene modifier in the page}
  go: {to: Start}

[note]
Director: she should feel cornered. This is Chapbook's own note modifier, and it
is not rendered.

[continued]
Normal Chapbook Markdown is still not rendered here, because this passage has a
scene. Every way out of a scene passage has to be in its `links:`.

:: Scene modifier patch
A scene with `from:` is a patch over another scene's state, not a snapshot.
Anything it doesn't mention is inherited.

[scene]
id: tavern-fight
from: tavern-night@tense
cast:
  mira: {frame: angry}
beats:
  - mira: "Then draw."
links:
  back: {to: Scene modifier}

:: Scene modifier in the page
sliders.sceneOnly: false
sliders.fullScreen: false
--
Both halves of the default format are variables, so a passage can have its
Chapbook page back: a stage in a 16:9 box with **Markdown**, inserts and
{link to: 'Start', label: 'links'} around it.

[scene]
id: tavern-inline
from: tavern-night
beats:
  - box: "The same scene, sitting in the page."

[continued]
Text under the stage is drawn again, because `sliders.sceneOnly` is false here.

[[Scene modifier]]

:: Scene modifier errors
A scene that doesn't parse still renders whatever could be understood, and
reports the rest through Chapbook's warning list rather than throwing.

[scene]
id: broken
bgg: typo-in-a-top-level-key
cast:
  mira: {at: nonsense, layer: sideways}
beats:
  - wait: soon
links:
  nowhere: {}
  back: {to: Start}
